              "text": "laetor, laetārī — \"to rejoice, be glad\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Māter laetātur, quod fīlius sānus redit. The mother rejoices because her son comes home healthy."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Deponent: laetor, laetārī, laetātus sum. With the ablative or with dē: victōriā laetor — I rejoice at the victory."
            }
          ]
        },
